    Says "'Dear God, the bread,' says {innkeeper_c}, with a catch of laughter. 'You were not there at the Station? The bailiff walked the first mile. In his boots, it is true. But he walked it, and the clerk read the leave out in the round hand, and the old priest came out and said the response in a voice I have not heard from him since I was a boy. They have kept the Walk every year since, on the first of the thaw. There are forty people in my yard and not one of them has asked for credit.'".
