  }
  Topic inn_after_riot_a with innkeeper_a "Ask {innkeeper_a} how the Walk ended" when ending(e_riot) once {
    Says "'It was a day,' says {innkeeper_a}, 'that I do not want to see twice.' The hands on the bar are quite steady. 'Nine dead that anyone will admit to. The stalls burnt. The Bench's men, and the sergeant, and the Brethren, and the lads, and God help us a crowd of people who had never in their lives hit anyone. There is curfew at dusk. I have nothing in the larder; I do not think anyone in the town does.' A pause. 'The Mile-Keeper did not finish the number.'".
  }
  Topic inn_after_riot_b with innkeeper_b "Ask {innkeeper_b} how the Walk ended" when ending(e_riot) once {
    Says "'It was a day,' says {innkeeper_b}, 'that I do not want to see twice.' The hands on the bar are quite steady. 'Nine dead that anyone will admit to. The stalls burnt. The Bench's men, and the sergeant, and the Brethren, and the lads, and God help us a crowd of people who had never in their lives hit anyone. There is curfew at dusk. I have nothing in the larder; I do not think anyone in the town does.' A pause. 'The Mile-Keeper did not finish the number.'".
  }
