  }
  Topic inn_after_fades_a with innkeeper_a "Ask {innkeeper_a} how the Walk ended" when ending(e_fades) once {
    Says "'It just stopped,' says {innkeeper_a}. 'There was no Bench and no Brethren and no steward at the end of it. They went home. They said the names and went home, on the road, the way you leave a feast when it is over. It rained on the chalk.' A shrug. 'I miss the singing. I did not think I should.'".
  }
